      "type": "game",
      "name": "It Is Ticking",
      "steam_appid": 2412700,
      "required_age": 0,
      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "Experience the high-stakes world of chaos in this thrilling game! As a bomb-defusing expert, it's your duty to protect innocent lives from the terrorists' deadly explosives that threaten our cities. Time is of the essence, as these bombs are set to detonate within moments.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/6ca9e3dfabe07273c60857b47e318d12.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Master the art of understanding current flow as you work against the clock to disable the detonator. But be cautious! Once a wire is cut, there's no going back, and a wrong move could lead to an inevitable explosion.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/b1ac7da34606af7ade1f2f9ba2310b24.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Each component follows its own logical rules, so stay focused and steer clear of triggering disaster. The countdown is on, and the pressure is intense.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/91128033f114a19103e3e604218a12a6.poster.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/91128033f114a19103e3e604218a12a6.webm?t=1711282155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/91128033f114a19103e3e604218a12a6.mp4?t=1711282155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Introducing the Workshop mode, where you can unleash your creativity and embrace the dark side. Ever dreamed of being a mastermind behind these lethal devices? The possibilities are endless as you construct your very own bombs using an array of components at your disposal. Build and fine-tune your creation with ease, then share your devious designs with the world through the integrated Steam Workshop. No external tools are required—everything you need is within the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/9382fc1959bf0069da23d094c42f2f8e.poster.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/9382fc1959bf0069da23d094c42f2f8e.webm?t=1711282155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/9382fc1959bf0069da23d094c42f2f8e.mp4?t=1711282155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Put your logical thinking skills to the ultimate test across hundreds of challenging stages. Will you rise to the occasion and save the innocent? With every wire you cut, every switch you flip, and every second that ticks away, the fate of countless lives hangs in the balance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/42f5fda5de116ef1dd789ed884c3abd1.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Find a way to disarm the bombs, navigate the intricate components, and remember one thing above all else—it's ticking. Can you handle the pressure?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/0163a94cc92dc750ec2a98fac4c8bc58.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 /></span>",
      "about_the_game": "Experience the high-stakes world of chaos in this thrilling game! As a bomb-defusing expert, it's your duty to protect innocent lives from the terrorists' deadly explosives that threaten our cities. Time is of the essence, as these bombs are set to detonate within moments.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/6ca9e3dfabe07273c60857b47e318d12.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Master the art of understanding current flow as you work against the clock to disable the detonator. But be cautious! Once a wire is cut, there's no going back, and a wrong move could lead to an inevitable explosion.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/b1ac7da34606af7ade1f2f9ba2310b24.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br>Each component follows its own logical rules, so stay focused and steer clear of triggering disaster. The countdown is on, and the pressure is intense.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/91128033f114a19103e3e604218a12a6.poster.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/91128033f114a19103e3e604218a12a6.webm?t=1711282155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/91128033f114a19103e3e604218a12a6.mp4?t=1711282155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Introducing the Workshop mode, where you can unleash your creativity and embrace the dark side. Ever dreamed of being a mastermind behind these lethal devices? The possibilities are endless as you construct your very own bombs using an array of components at your disposal. Build and fine-tune your creation with ease, then share your devious designs with the world through the integrated Steam Workshop. No external tools are required—everything you need is within the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/9382fc1959bf0069da23d094c42f2f8e.poster.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/9382fc1959bf0069da23d094c42f2f8e.webm?t=1711282155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/9382fc1959bf0069da23d094c42f2f8e.mp4?t=1711282155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Put your logical thinking skills to the ultimate test across hundreds of challenging stages. Will you rise to the occasion and save the innocent? With every wire you cut, every switch you flip, and every second that ticks away, the fate of countless lives hangs in the balance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/42f5fda5de116ef1dd789ed884c3abd1.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><br>Find a way to disarm the bombs, navigate the intricate components, and remember one thing above all else—it's ticking. Can you handle the pressure?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2412700/extras/0163a94cc92dc750ec2a98fac4c8bc58.avif?t=1711282155\" width=600 height=338 /></span>",
      "short_description": "Play a bomb defuse simulation based on logic gates. The world is being attacked by terrorists, they use highly dangerous explosive devices to cause massive destruction in urban zones. You, A bomb-defusing expert, must take action to protect our nation's lives.",
      "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
      "reviews": "“A solid, stress-inducing and rewarding puzzler about disarming ticking bomb! Quickly learn electronic board system, different challenge, it offer a good level editor and support worshop too..try it!”<br>Crazy Old Man<br><br>“Explosive devices and how to defuse them have always been popular topics for condemnation . In this game we are the diffuser, try your best and save the world .”<br>Mens'Club<br><br>“It Is Ticking симулятор который окунет вас в суровые будни взрывотехников. На наши плечи лягут задачи по разминированию бомб. Игра сочетает в себе отличный сим и логическую головоломку.”<br>Gaming Grandma<br>",
